      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MARVIN MONELLI (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 19.95 beating VICTOR CARGO. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Form reads well for this. DUST CARGO (7) missed the frame latest but had been racing well prior to that including a Grade 5 win two back (25.32) at this track. Has the ability and expected to do much better. ARMATREE PEARLER (6) was a course and distance placegetter (20.05) last time also from the same draw, finishing a 1.5 lengths third in a Grade 5. Has the ability and looks a key chance. VINNIE ZACAPA (3) is very honest and looms as a strong winning hope again.",
